s with the third album [url=https://www.discogs.com/master/12165-Prodigy-The-Fat-Of-The-Land]\"The Fat Of The Land\"[/url] (1997).\n\nBand members:\n[a=Liam Howlett] - head of the group, keyboards, synthesizers, programming, laptop, computer, samples, interpolations, sequencers, turntables, drum machines (1990-present)\n[a=Maxim] - MC, beatboxing, vocals (1991-present)\n\nFormer members:\n[a=Keith Flint] - dancing (1990-2019); lead vocals (1995-2019)\n[a=Leeroy Thornhill] - dancing (1990-2000); occasional live keyboards, synthesizers (1994-2000)\nSharky - dancing (1990-1991)\n\nThe original Prodigy line-up was Liam on keyboards and Leeroy, Keith and Sharky as dancers, formed in late 1990 (The Prodigy officially name the date October 5, 1990). Maxim was recruited at short notice to MC at their debut gig at Labrynth in Dalston, London in February 1991. Sharky left the group at Christmas 1990 after they got their record deal with XL as she didn't want to devote more time to the band. Their initial deal with XL was for 4 singles, with XL paying a £1500 advance prior to the first single.\n[a=Liam Howlett] briefly used the pseudonym [a=Earthbound (6)] (named after Liam's studio) for the original white-label summer releases of [url=https://www.discogs.com/master/12254-The-Prodigy-One-Love]\"One Love\"[/url] (1993).\nSharky left the band in 1991\n[a=Leeroy Thornhill] left the band in 2000. \n[a=Keith Flint] died by hanging on 4 March 2019.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:66852","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":1229070,"name":"Earthbound (6)"}],"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":34027,"name":"Liam Howlett"},{"active":false,"id":118654,"name":"Keith Flint"},{"active":false,"id":160004,"name":"Leeroy Thornhill"},{"active":true,"id":625137,"name":"Keith Palmer"}],"namevariations":["Da Prodigy","New Prodigy","PA Prodigy","Proddigy","Prodigi","Prodigy","Prodigy Remixed","Prodigy-97","Prodigy-98","Prodigy.","The Prodhige","The Prodige","The Prodigi","プロディジー","神童","超凡合唱團","超凡樂團","프로디지"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/66852-The-Prodigy","type":"artist","urls":["http://www.theprodigy.com","http://theprodigy.bandcamp.com","http://www.dailymotion.com/TheProdigy-Official","http://www.facebook.com/theprodigyofficial","http://www.flickr.com/photos/the-prodigy","http://www.imdb.com/name/nm1980220","http://instagram.com/theprodigyofficial","http://myspace.com/theprodigy","http://soundcloud.com/theprodigy","http://twitter.com/the_prodigy","http://vimeo.com/theprodigy","http://vk.com/theprodigy","http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Prodigy","http://www.whosampled.com/The-Prodigy","http://www.youtube.com/user/ProdigyChannel","http://www.youtube.com/user/TheProdigyVEVO"]}},"/api/discogs/label/1060815/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"1060815","image":"https://i.discogs.com/9SJF1DC9Vr_Ihe0dXUJGbWYbalT9kBjcdSb4SQZK05A/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTEwNjA4/MTUtMTUxNjY0NDM2/My02NTQwLmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/M53HFTKBM0FHmljPpXkeT9a7NP56sydsUkS42frubIQ/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTEwNjA4/MTUtMTUxNjY0NDM2/My02NTQwLmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"Founded by DJ [a4402823], supplying house, disco, techno & everything in between...","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:1060815","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/1060815-On-Loop","type":"label","urls":["https://www.facebook.com/pg/OnLoopOfficial/ ","https://www.instagram.com/onloopofficial/","https://onloop.bandcamp.com"]}},"/api/discogs/label/3431338/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"3431338","image":"https://i.discogs.com/gx6C9IWQU_SBlVzGm4l8Rqjbz9shRkFY146KVbeqjYI/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTM0MzEz/MzgtMTc2ODA4Njg5/OC0yMDI5LmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/Oxna59woCeJg9kdhIlJFFEFSrKsSm29Apen4YOLmmiU/rs:fit/g:sm/q: